TopicAttack baseline — third-party code
=======================================

The directory `topicattack-main/` vendors the reference implementation of:

    TopicAttack: An Indirect Prompt Injection Attack via Topic Transition
    (EMNLP 2025).  https://arxiv.org/pdf/2507.13686

It is included here only to reproduce the TopicAttack comparison row of the
paper. All credit for that code belongs to its original authors, and it
remains under whatever license the upstream project grants. The files under
`run_topicattack_with_defense.py`, `run_defense_comparison.py`,
`run_all_suites_with_defense.sh`, and the `*.md` guides in this directory are
the adaptation glue written for this project (MIT, as the repository root).

If you redistribute this repository, confirm the upstream TopicAttack license
permits it; otherwise replace `topicattack-main/` with a clone of the upstream
repository at run time.
